  id: k_banh_mi_bulgogi
  recipeName: "K-B\xE1nh M\xEC Bulgogi"
  region: Fusion
  basePrice: 140
  dishDescription: "V\u1ECF b\xE1nh m\xEC gi\xF2n k\u1EB9p th\u1ECBt b\xF2 Bulgogi
    n\u01B0\u1EDBng \u01B0\u1EDBp v\u1ECB n\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u1EADm
    \u0111\xE0, \u0103n k\xE8m kim chi c\u1EA3i th\u1EA3o chua gi\xF2n gi\u1EA3m
    ng\u1EA5y."
  culturalStory: "M\xF3n \u0103n k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p gi\u1EEFa \u1ED5 b\xE1nh m\xEC
    gi\xF2n ki\u1EC3u Vi\u1EC7t Nam v\xE0 nh\xE2n th\u1ECBt b\xF2 n\u01B0\u1EDBng
    Bulgogi truy\u1EC1n th\u1ED1ng H\xE0n Qu\u1ED1c k\xE8m kim chi, mang l\u1EA1i
    h\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1ECB \xC1 \u0110\xF4ng quen thu\u1ED9c m\xE0 m\u1EDBi m\u1EBB."
  flavorProfile: "V\u1ECF b\xE1nh gi\xF2n, th\u1ECBt b\xF2 n\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\u1EADm
    v\u1ECB n\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u01B0\u01A1ng ng\u1ECDt m\u1EB7n h\xE0i h\xF2a, kim
    chi chua thanh"
  chefTip: "N\u01B0\u1EDBng th\u1ECBt b\xF2 ch\xEDn \u0111\u1EC1u tr\xEAn v\u1EC9
    v\xE0 \xE9p gi\xF2n v\u1ECF b\xE1nh m\xEC trong l\xF2, k\u1EB9p c\xF9ng kim chi
    v\xE0 r\u01B0\u1EDBi th\xEAm n\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u01B0\u01A1ng."
